{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/26086","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/26086/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/26086/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/26086/events","html_url":"https://github.com/symfony/symfony/issues/26086","id":295417386,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyOTU0MTczODY=","number":26086,"title":"[FrameworkBundle] Annotation cache does not override default settings","user":{"login":"Laizerox","id":53072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laizerox","html_url":"https://github.com/Laizerox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laizerox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laizerox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laizerox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laizerox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laizerox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laizerox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laizerox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laizerox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laizerox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":100079,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDAwNzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"e10c02","default":false,"description":null},{"id":148416,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDg0MTY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/labels/FrameworkBundle","name":"FrameworkBundle","color":"DDDDDD","default":false,"description":null},{"id":237003792,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzcwMDM3OTI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/labels/Status:%20Needs%20Review","name":"Status: Needs Review","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2018-02-08T08:02:14Z","updated_at":"2018-02-19T16:40:16Z","closed_at":"2018-02-19T16:40:16Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"| Q                | A\r\n| ---------------- | -----\r\n| Bug report?      | yes\r\n| Feature request? | no\r\n| BC Break report? | no\r\n| RFC?             | no\r\n| Symfony version  | 3.4.4\r\n\r\nAs the title describes when defined in config.yml\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\nframework:\r\n    annotations:\r\n        cache: doctrine_cache.providers.annotations.cache\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe `annotation_reader` does not get injected with proper cache but remains as ArrayCache.\r\n\r\nThe problem appears to happen when `AddAnnotationsCachedReaderPass` is being processed definition of `annotations.cached_reader` is already removed and `$container->hasDefinition('annotations.cached_reader')` returns false.\r\n\r\nDefault settings such as `file` for `framework.annotations.cache` does not appear to work either.\r\n\r\nWhen default cache is being overridden in `annotations.xml` of `FrameworkBundle` manually it appears the cache starts to work.\r\n\r\nWhen using bundles such as FOSRestBundle the lack of cache causes `annotation_reader` to parse annotations on each request.\r\n\r\nEither I'm doing something wrong or this has broken at some stage.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"nicolas-grekas","id":243674,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzY3NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243674?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolas-grekas","html_url":"https://github.com/nicolas-grekas","followers_ur